    "methods_description": "MEG was recorded with a 275-channel CTF system while participants watched the Chinese-dubbed Forrest Gump movie. T1w images were processed with the fMRIPrep anatomical pipeline. MEG data were preprocessed with MNE: bad channel detection and removal, 1 Hz high-pass filtering, and ICA-based artifact removal. Data are organized in MEG-BIDS using MNE-BIDS.",
